19/1012330974333374464153942.png/IcsCifwOi3bs63wCLIa5iXROqIR18bFgH3xAPx98QD8\"/><figcaption>柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012330972592607232728163.png/dGaWQU8n8rSiKrOzQEaVI5IlRzcLzv87X8DsoV_A7KE\"/><figcaption>柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012330969023123456074589.png/v5bZ56ZY-PzTYAoqPnU-wgP7xR0j6od93s5lc97OZXM\"/><figcaption>柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012330970235277312538497.png/DYp-d6XkBzgzK7q-s7qyUkdlTXUisM7-iiZI-IomSPg\"/><figcaption>柯震東（IG@kaikaiko）</figcaption></figure><p>JYP一天兩震！男團隊長宣布離團+退社　前女友爆他「私下辱罵粉絲」</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T12:39:24.301914+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1286,"images":46,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}